/T (What is the purpose of this research?  The purpose of this research is to investigate the effectiveness of a serious game as a learning tool for teaching fundamental Python programming concepts to beginners. The study aims to determine whether learning  through an interactive educational game can improve participants' understanding of Python compared with  their knowledge before playing the game. )
/E (What is the purpose of this research?  The purpose of this research is to investigate the effectiveness of a serious game as a learning tool for teaching fundamental Python programming concepts to beginners. The study aims to determine whether learning  through an interactive educational game can improve participants' understanding of Python compared with  their knowledge before playing the game. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [18]
>>
