/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 66 0 R
/T (The serious game has been designed to teach core Python topics, including variables, data types, input and output, operators, collections, conditional statements, loops, and dictionaries, through interactive 2d platformer with problem-solving activities. To evaluate its effectiveness, participants will complete a short pre-test before playing the game and the same test as a post-test after completing the game. The results will be compared to measure any improvement in learning outcomes. )
/E (The serious game has been designed to teach core Python topics, including variables, data types, input and output, operators, collections, conditional statements, loops, and dictionaries, through interactive 2d platformer with problem-solving activities. To evaluate its effectiveness, participants will complete a short pre-test before playing the game and the same test as a post-test after completing the game. The results will be compared to measure any improvement in learning outcomes. )
