/T (What will you do in the project?  You will be asked to evaluate an educational serious game designed to teach fundamental Python programming concepts. The study will involve completing a short knowledge test before using the game, playing the game,  and then completing the same knowledge test afterwards to measure any changes in your understanding. The study will take approximately 45 minutes to complete everything. \(location not decided yet\). There is no  payment or reimbursement provided for participating in this study. Your participation will help evaluate the effectiveness of serious games as a method for supporting the learning of introductory Python programming concepts. )
