704 0 obj
<<
/Title (The information collected during this research will only be accessible to the researcher and the academic supervisor responsible for overseeing this MSc dissertation project at the University of Strathclyde. The collected data will be stored securely and will only be used for the purposes of this research.  Participants' personal information will remain confidential, and any data used for analysis will be anonymised or pseudonymised to prevent individuals from being identified. The results will be presented as aggregated findings in the dissertation report, and no identifiable participant information will be included in any presentations or future academic publications.)
