707 0 obj
<<
/Title (What information is being collected in the project?  This research will collect information to evaluate the effectiveness of the educational serious game in improving participants' understanding of fundamental Python programming concepts. The collected data will include responses from pre-test and post-test assessments, feedback on participants' experience and perception of the game, and gameplay-related information such as stage completion, scores, achievements, or progress where applicable.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 712 0 R
/Next 703 0 R
>>
